{"unit":12,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Final Test · Unit 12","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Final Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 12 &middot; Final Test &middot; end of level</div>\n      <h2>The world of work</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx252\">Thirty questions on Unit 12 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like. This is the last test of the level.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u12\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u12r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r102\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;ve worked here &hellip; 2019.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">since</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">for</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">from</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She&rsquo;s been a nurse &hellip; eleven years.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">for</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">since</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">from</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">How long &hellip; you known him?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">My job is &hellip; the work visible.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">to make</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">making</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r103\">Put the verb in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>be</i>) He <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"has been|'s been\" data-why=\"Started in the past, still true: <b>has been</b> an accountant since&hellip;\"> an accountant since he left university.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>work</i>) They <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"have worked|'ve worked|have been working\" data-why=\"<i>For six years</i> and still true: <b>have worked</b>.\"> in construction for six years.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>find</i>) It is difficult <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"to find\" data-why=\"<i>It is difficult</i> + the infinitive with <b>to</b>.\"> a good candidate.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r104\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">It&rsquo;s important &hellip; on time for an interview.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">to be</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">being</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;ve known her &hellip; we were at school.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">since</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">for</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">from</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">She came &hellip; about the job.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">to ask</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">for ask</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"2\" data-why=\"<i>Since 2019</i> and still true &rarr; Present Perfect: <i>I <b>have worked</b> here since 2019</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">work</span> <span class=\"ew\">here</span> <span class=\"ew\">since</span> <span class=\"ew\">2019</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"After <i>It&rsquo;s important</i> we use the infinitive with <b>to</b>: <i>to be polite</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">It&rsquo;s</span> <span class=\"ew\">important</span> <span class=\"ew\">being</span> <span class=\"ew\">polite</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">She became a judge in 2015 and she is still a judge.<br>She <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"has been a judge since 2015|'s been a judge since 2015\" data-why=\"Started at a point in the past, still true: <b>has been a judge since 2015</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">My job involves training new staff.<br>My job is <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"to train new staff|to train new staff.\" data-why=\"<b>My job is to&hellip;</b> + the infinitive.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u12r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">An <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"accountant\" data-why=\"An <b>accountant</b> keeps and checks financial records.\"> keeps and checks the financial records of a company.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">A <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"judge\" data-why=\"A <b>judge</b> decides cases in court.\"> decides legal cases in court.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">There are almost no inside walls. It is an <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"open-plan|open plan\" data-why=\"<b>Open-plan</b> = with few or no inside walls.\"> office.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Scientists do their experiments in a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"laboratory\" data-why=\"A <b>laboratory</b> is a room with equipment for scientific work.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">We need to <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"recruit\" data-why=\"<b>Recruit</b> = find new people and bring them into a company.\"> three new engineers this year.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">A person who is trying to get the job is a &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">candidate</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">client</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">customer</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Sorry, I can&rsquo;t stop &mdash; I&rsquo;m &hellip; a hurry.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">in</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">at</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">Could you explain that &hellip; detail?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">in</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">with</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">on</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are places where people work. A <b>profession</b> is a type of job.\"><span class=\"ew\">office</span> <span class=\"ew\">laboratory</span> <span class=\"ew\">court</span> <span class=\"ew\">profession</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are phrases with <i>in</i>. <b>Paperwork</b> is a noun on its own.\"><span class=\"ew\">in a mess</span> <span class=\"ew\">in trouble</span> <span class=\"ew\">in the middle</span> <span class=\"ew\">paperwork</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u12r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; me about yourself.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Tell</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Say</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Speak</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">&ldquo;What is your greatest weakness?&rdquo; The best answer is&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;I don&rsquo;t have any.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;I take on too much, so I am learning to ask for help earlier.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;I am always late.&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">On a CV: References available on &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">request</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">demand</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">asking</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">I work well with other people. I am a good team <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"player\" data-why=\"A <b>team player</b> works well together with other people.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">My greatest <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"strength\" data-why=\"A <b>strength</b> is something you are good at &mdash; the opposite of a weakness.\"> is that I stay calm under pressure.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u12r114\">Put the three sections of a CV in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Work experience</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Education and qualifications</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Personal profile</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}